            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.49</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Uses port 12321 for new bridge setup and defaults the OpenClaw agent name to main.</li>
  <li>Adds an OpenClaw Agent field for users who need to target a different local agent.</li>
  <li>Clarifies the optional non-Tailscale HTTPS bridge setup for Apple Watch use away from iPhone relay.</li>
  <li>Makes update checks enabled by default and improves Diagnostics version/build visibility.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
